## Structure

```
src/main/java/com/example/project/
├── Application.java                    ← entry point
├── errors/                             ← global error handling
├── shared/                             ← cross-cutting concerns
│   ├── database/                       ← ORM setup
│   ├── cache/                          ← Redis config
│   ├── auth/                           ← JWT security
│   ├── health/                         ← health endpoints
│   ├── kafka/                          ← Kafka config
│   └── rabbitmq/                       ← RabbitMQ config
├── domain/
│   ├── model/                          ← domain entities (no framework deps)
│   ├── port/in/                        ← input ports (use case interfaces)
│   ├── port/out/                       ← output ports (repository interfaces)
│   └── service/                        ← domain services
├── adapter/
│   ├── in/web/                         ← REST controllers + DTOs
│   │   └── dto/
│   └── out/persistence/               ← JPA entities + repository impl
```

## Commands

```bash
./mvnw spring-boot:run              # dev server on :8080
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d                # start databases/brokers
docker compose down
{{/if}}
{{#if useCheckstyle}}
./mvnw checkstyle:check             # lint
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
./mvnw test                         # run tests
{{/if}}
```

